{"title": "Fugitive (Condition)", "pageid": 32571, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fugitive_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fugitive Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Fugitive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Fugitive</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Recently escaped from prison. Guards will arrest this prisoner on sight. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Only applies to the area where the character is escaping from. For example, a character who is a fugitive from the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a> will not be arrested by guards from the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid_Grove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druid Grove\">Druid Grove</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Fugitive\">Sources of Fugitive</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Crime\" title=\"Crime\">Crime</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 810/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7241/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2492/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 990066/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.667      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   32.667      1 -total\n 57.93%   18.923      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.26%    7.924      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 11.53%    3.765      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.86%    3.548      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.83%    3.539     10 Template:Trim\n 10.13%    3.310      2 Template:Template_style\n  8.93%    2.918      1 Template:Icon_link\n  8.01%    2.618      1 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache 